Your task is to guess the precondition of an ordinary differential equation (ODE).
You are given the ODE specification in differential game logic (dGL) and Angel's desired postcondition.
You must compute the precondition under which Angel can ensure that the postcondition holds after the ODE evolution, while respecting the evolution domain constraint.

You should provide a precondition that is logically sound according to the semantics of differential dynamic logic.
